name: Partial source context stays explicit through local discovery, report and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/import-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT partial | partial-map-receipt
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 15 Acknowledge & use partial | partial-map-result
expect-not: u Accept result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART pending
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 partial | partial-map-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 partial | partial-map-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 partial | partial-map-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 partial | partial-map-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 partial | partial-map-40x12
expect: Use partial
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY | canonical-result-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART limit-page
live-snap: partial-limit-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 15 unknown | partial-limit-tail-40x12
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | unresolved-result-return-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART pending
ask: Does partial context retain a readable inspection limit and unknown coverage at every size, with explicit acknowledgment rather than an ordinary success action?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | acknowledged-partial-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | partial-architecture
expect: grounding partial
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | finite-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | three-fixed-jobs
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-review
type: 1
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | reviewed-local-work
expect: Execution model: none
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | separate-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | local-scan-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scanned
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 completed 3 / planned 3 | completed-study
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Owned policy marker needs an owner decision | policy-finding
submit: decision deferred Owned static policy needs an owner decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | partial-context-report
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: report-limits-40x12
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: Home p
require-live-snap: 20 Context limitation: | report-context-details
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-limit-page
live-snap: report-context-limit-40x12
keys: p
ask: Does Report distinguish completed approved scans from partial context coverage, preserve three observations and a human deferral, and disclose no provider spending?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain partial context, its explicit acknowledgment, exact scan provenance and the owner decision without new scans, model requests or source execution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
